      "id": "claim_b896cddbf606441285a9934ac2889bd9",
      "statement": "The Sensorboard's GPIO7 Display-5V switch uses an N-channel pre-driver Q5 (2N7002) ahead of the P-channel high-side switch Q4 (AO3401A), confirmed present in both the Rev. 0.4 and Rev. 0.5 production BOMs and documented in sensor_config.h as fixing an earlier single-FET design that caused a direct gate-source through-current when GPIO7 was driven HIGH; sensor_config.h states the current pin assignments apply only to this new, undamaged board revision.",
