    {
      "id": "claim_df63cc9219404df1b70d61bed6fe260f",
      "statement": "The Sensorboard's J7 connector (10-pin Molex Micro-Fit 3.0, 43045-1012) is wired directly into the vehicle's original Schaudt EBL/LT45x control-panel interface: its BOM entry is labelled 'LT452 Malibu', and sensor_config.h independently confirms a 2026-08-30 reversed-polarity incident at 'Steckverbinder J7 (\"LT452 Malibu\", 10-pol. Molex Micro-Fit)' that hard-damaged GPIO13 and GPIO17, establishing that the Sensorboard physically and electrically replaces the LT45x panel's position and EBL-facing wiring rather than being an independent add-on.",
